{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":233,"count":31,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L06-1-16\",\"跑\",\"跑\",\"跑\",\"Vi\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我妹妹跑得很慢。","pinyin":"Wǒ mèimei pǎo de hěn màn.","english":"My younger sister runs very slowly.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-17","sourceFront":"慢","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我每個星期都去學校跑步。","pinyin":"Wǒ měi ge xīngqí dōu qù xuéxiào pǎobù.","english":"I go to school to run every week.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-15","sourceFront":"跑步","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我們去跑步，怎麼樣？","pinyin":"Wǒmen qù pǎobù, zěnmeyàng?","english":"How about we go running then?","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我不喜歡跑步，我跑步跑得很慢。","pinyin":"Wǒ bù xǐhuān pǎobù, wǒ pǎobù pǎo de hěn màn.","english":"I do not like to run; I run slowly.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-1-01","sourceFront":"打","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"a 口(mouth) shouts 止(stop) as 包(wrap) bundles legs → 跑(run)."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-04\",\"機場\",\"機場/飛機場\",\"机场/飞机场\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"從我家到機場也不遠，開車去、坐捷運去都可以。","pinyin":"Cóng wǒ jiā dào jīchǎng yě bù yuǎn, kāichē qù, zuò jiéyùn qù dōu kěyǐ.","english":"It is not far from my house to the airport. I can go by car or MRT.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2},{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"機場 means airport: a place (場) for machines (機) → the planes."},{"key":"[\"B1L09-1-01\",\"句子\",\"句子\",\"句子\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"友美，這幾個句子的意思我不太懂，妳可以教我嗎？","pinyin":"Yǒuměi, zhè jǐ ge jùzi de yìsi wǒ bú tài dǒng, nǐ kěyǐ jiāo wǒ ma?","english":"Youmei, I don’t quite understand these sentences. Could you teach me?","sourceCardId":"B1L09-1-01","sourceFront":"句子","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":"句(sentence) + 子(noun suffix) → a stretch of words: 句子(sentence)."},{"key":"[\"B1L14-2-12\",\"魚\",\"魚\",\"鱼\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這條魚很好吃，你多吃點兒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L14-2-12","sourceFront":"魚","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個用活魚做的菜又新鮮又好吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-1-45","sourceFront":"活","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"媽媽煎了一條魚，又煮了蘿蔔湯，看起來都很好吃。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-20","sourceFront":"煎","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今年的年夜飯有很多菜，雞鴨魚肉什麼都有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-2-04","sourceFront":"鴨子","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我和朋友昨天去河邊露營， 我們試著在河裡抓魚，沒想到真的抓到了五條魚","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-16","sourceFront":"抓","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"爺爺很喜歡在海邊釣魚，看著風景、吹著海風，他覺得舒服極了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-22","sourceFront":"釣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"秋天的天氣變化很大，早晚都有點涼，出門時最好帶件外套。 這碗魚湯要趁熱喝，涼了就不好喝了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-22","sourceFront":"涼","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小李第一次參加釣魚比賽就得了第一名，真是幸運。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L09-1-01","sourceFront":"得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小時候爺爺常陪我做功課、教我打球和釣魚，現在回想起那段時間，感覺真幸福。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-26","sourceFront":"回想","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"每個民族都有自己獨特的習俗，像華人除夕貼春聯、年夜飯的魚不能吃光就很特別。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-33","sourceFront":"習俗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個廚師很有一手，能用一條魚做出五道菜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-14","sourceFront":"一手","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這是我剛買回來的魚，吃起來又鮮又甜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-34","sourceFront":"鮮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這桌喜酒有很多海鮮，但我只能吃魚，其他種類的海鮮都會讓我皮膚紅腫(inflamed)。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-48","sourceFront":"海鮮","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"a 𠂊(bound hand) drops a 田(field) onto 灬(fire) → a cooked 魚(fish)."},{"key":"[\"B2L02-1-30\",\"小说\",\"小說\",\"小说\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你要把這些小說都丟了？太可惜了！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L02-1-31","sourceFront":"可惜","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"這本小說很有意思，值得推薦。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L04-2-27","sourceFront":"值得","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這一類的中文小說都放在圖書館的二樓。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L08-1-34","sourceFront":"類","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我每次翻譯日文小說的時候，都要查字典。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L09-1-25","sourceFront":"字典","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我把剛買回來的小說擺在書架上。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L11-1-03","sourceFront":"擺","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本小說是以愛情的題材寫成的，後來被拍成了一部浪漫的電影。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-2-06","sourceFront":"題材","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家公司出版的小說，陪著不少讀者一塊兒成長，也帶給他們無窮的樂趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-02","sourceFront":"無窮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本小說介紹了許多中國的古人古事，內容既豐富又有趣。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-2-32","sourceFront":"古人古事","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他想寫一本以各行各業人物當作題材的長篇小說。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-01","sourceFront":"各行各業","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這本小說的內容重複性太高，一點新鮮感都沒有。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-35","sourceFront":"重複性","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對我來說，閱讀醫學系列的小說是一個很好的休閒活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-1-04","sourceFront":"系列","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L06-2-08\",\"客满\",\"客滿\",\"客满\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"那家餐廳的菜又便宜又好吃，所以假日常常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L06-2-08","sourceFront":"客滿","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那家印尼餐廳常常客滿，你最好先打電話訂位。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-23","sourceFront":"訂位","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳的菜不僅平價，還很營養，常常中午十二點前舉客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-11","sourceFront":"平價","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我打工的餐廳一到週末就客滿，忙不過來的時候，連老闆的叔叔都得來幫忙。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-33","sourceFront":"忙不過來","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮那幾家旅館的雙人客房都客滿了，我們還是訂民宿吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-30","sourceFront":"客房","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一家餐廳要是受歡迎，就算把店關在郊區的某個小巷子裡，也還是時常客滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-05","sourceFront":"巷子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"元旦那天因為不少人放假，大部分餐廳都客滿了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-01","sourceFront":"元旦","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L11-1-19\",\"服務\",\"服務\",\"服务\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我參加了愛心服務社以後，想法比以前更成熟了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L12-2-14","sourceFront":"成熟","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"愛心服務社把社員的愛心聚在一起，到安養院去幫助老人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-15","sourceFront":"聚","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的服務生對客人很親切，讓客人都吃得很開心。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-29","sourceFront":"親切","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"愛心服務社社員去安養院陪老人過年，讓老人們感覺相當溫暖。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-30","sourceFront":"相當","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"許多大學生參加愛心服務的社團，幫助老人打掃環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-2-09","sourceFront":"許多","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"便利商店的服務有賣票、收電話費和水電費等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-02","sourceFront":"服務","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那位服務生不笑的時候，樣子看起來很兇，其實他對客人的態度很好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-2-25","sourceFront":"凶","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想要吸引顧客來購買價格高的商品，除了品質好，服務態度也很重要。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-34","sourceFront":"購買","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳不僅服務態度好，而且食物好吃又便宜，難怪大家都推薦我來嚐嚐。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-03","sourceFront":"不僅","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個活動會場有服務中心，想找人的話，可以請服務人員廣播。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-27","sourceFront":"廣播","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A: 現在的科技提供非常好用的網路服務，而且很多都是免費的。 B: 好用倒是好用，可是萬一沒有網路，就什麼都做不了了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-1-05","sourceFront":"倒是","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他參加了服務社團的活動後，生活比過去更豐富、更有意義。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-28","sourceFront":"過去","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個國家公園的服務中心提供遊客簡介，介紹公園的特色和有名的景點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-03","sourceFront":"簡介","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為店員的服務態度很好，所以這個專櫃的銷售成績是最好的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-2-12","sourceFront":"銷售","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家電腦公司本來只服務亞洲地區的民眾，現在服務範圍已經擴大到歐洲了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-1-28","sourceFront":"範圍","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學生與校長當面對話，希望學校改善教學設備和校園餐廳的服務品質","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"易先生從職場退休後，就加入了醫院的服務社團，繼續為社會貢獻一份力量。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-16","sourceFront":"職場","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過服務人員詳細地說明，使得客人對公司的產品更了解了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-13","sourceFront":"使得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"要是你在百貨公司掉了東西，可以去服務中心的櫃臺問問。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-16","sourceFront":"櫃臺","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的服務生很貼心，只要客人一上門，立刻提供面紙給客人擦手。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-35","sourceFront":"貼心","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我想加入社會服務組織，幫助別人的同時也讓自己成長。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-06","sourceFront":"組織","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"臺灣的超商有店到店的送貨服務，不但速度快，運費也不貴。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-40","sourceFront":"運費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那家餐廳的服務生很厲害，一隻手能端好幾個盤子。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-22","sourceFront":"端","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你帶著邀請卡給門口的服務人員檢查，才能入場參加活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-14","sourceFront":"入場","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如果想入會員並享受我們健身房所提供的服務，請您到櫃臺辦理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-15","sourceFront":"入","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在這家餐廳，沒有人替你服務，點菜、拿碗筷等一切都得自助。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-02","sourceFront":"自助","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這所學校規定學生每兩週至少參加一次服務學習活動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-09","sourceFront":"週","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"班機起飛前，服務人員都會為旅客說明應注意的安全規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-43","sourceFront":"班機","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"行動不方便的乘客乘車時，車站有服務員為他們服務。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-03","sourceFront":"乘客","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家餐廳的帳單已經加了服務費了，你不必再給小費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-04","sourceFront":"小費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我曾經在賣精油的商店服務過一段時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-2-10","sourceFront":"精油","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"個人在使用各式各樣的網路服務時，也應該注意隱私問題。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-18","sourceFront":"隱私","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"個性親切、大方，通常是從事服務業的最佳人才。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-11","sourceFront":"人才","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他對志工服務一向有興趣，哪怕做得又忙又累，他也願意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-34","sourceFront":"哪怕","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"對顧客來說，品牌代表了對公司服務的印象以及商品的品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-07","sourceFront":"品牌","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 服(wear) and 務(affairs): 服務 means service."},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-22\",\"等等\",\"等等\",\"等等\",\"Ptc\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"電腦、手機、平板等等，都是3C產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-22","sourceFront":"等等","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"這個我覺得最難忘的回憶應該是跟「第一次」相關的經驗，比如第一次戀愛、第一次當背包客等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-1-15","sourceFront":"難忘","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"出國留學有不少好處，例如打開視野、增加自信、提高外文程度等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-20","sourceFront":"例如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"一般來說，面試時要準備的相關文件包括個人基本資料、畢業證書等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L13-1-14","sourceFront":"證書","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"按照華人的習俗，紅包裡面的錢不可以是四百、四千等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-04","sourceFront":"按照","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"大自然除了有各種動植物，還有山地、平原、河流等等，這一切應該是上帝創造的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-34","sourceFront":"大自然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華人社會中有很多重要的節日，比方(說)中秋節、農曆新年等等。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-12","sourceFront":"比方說","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-33\",\"总统\",\"總統\",\"总统\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"參加這次總統選舉的人實力都不錯，最後是陳先生當選了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L07-2-11","sourceFront":"當選","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次地震的規模很大，連總統一時也很難掌握各地的災情。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-08","sourceFront":"掌握","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統抵達新聞說明會的現場前，安全人員得先確認記者的資料，還得檢查他們的背包。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-01","sourceFront":"抵達","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"「總統」是國家最高領導人，他領導全國民眾往前走，讓國家越來越進步。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-13","sourceFront":"領導","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統對國家的貢獻很大，全國民眾都很尊敬他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-14","sourceFront":"全","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統處理任何問題時，最先想到的應該是國家的利益，不是個人的利益。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-06","sourceFront":"利益","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"國家跟國家之間的外交關係很重要，這方面的工作是總統負責的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-08","sourceFront":"外交","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那名記者為了訪問總統外交、貿易等方面的問題，閱讀了許多相關的資料。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-10","sourceFront":"訪問","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統到地震災區慰問災民，並保證會協助他們恢復正常的生活。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-1-09","sourceFront":"慰問","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"總統在廣場點燃煙火，跟民眾一起慶祝新年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-28","sourceFront":"點燃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L02-1-20\",\"西餐\",\"西餐\",\"西餐\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 西(west) and 餐(eat): 西餐 means western-style cuisine."},{"key":"[\"B3L06-1-42\",\"練\",\"練\",\"练\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這個學期開始，從星期一到星期五我都有華語課，每天從上午八點四十分到中午十二點上課，下午一點寫功課，有時候也跟同學練習說中文。","pinyin":"Zhè ge xuéqí kāishǐ, cóng xīngqí yī dào xīngqí wǔ, wǒ dōu yǒu Huáyǔ kè, měi tiān cóng shàngwǔ bā diǎn sìshí fēn dào zhōngwǔ shí’èr diǎn shàngkè, xiàwǔ yī diǎn xiě gōngkè, yǒushíhou yě gēn tóngxué liànxí shuō Zhōngwén.","english":"This semester I have Chinese class from 8:40 a.m. to 12:00 noon, Mondays to Fridays. I start to do my homework at 1:00 p.m., and sometimes I practice speaking Chinese with my classmates.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 糹(silk) thread holds a 柬(card) loop tight → day after day of 練(drill)."},{"key":"[\"B3L06-2-07\",\"酒吧\",\"酒吧\",\"酒吧\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他昨天在酒吧的花費，比我一個月的生活費還高。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-13","sourceFront":"花費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 酒(wine) and 吧(emphatic final particle): 酒吧 means bar."},{"key":"[\"B3L16-2-26\",\"如此\",\"如此\",\"如此\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"淡水的夕陽很美，如此的美麗風景，是約會的極佳地點。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-26","sourceFront":"如此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"大家都知道喝太多酒對身體沒有好處，但不少人仍然如此，甚至天天喝醉","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-26","sourceFront":"如此","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"剛學的詞和語法最好常使用、多複習，如此才能加深記憶。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-2-16","sourceFront":"加深","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 如(if) and 此(this): 如此 means in this way."},{"key":"[\"B4L02-2-03\",\"消费\",\"消費\",\"消费\",\"V/N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在開心消費前應先想想，那些商品是不是需要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-03","sourceFront":"消費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"假如東西買回家後常擺著不用，那樣的消費就是不必要的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-03","sourceFront":"消費","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1},{"chinese":"按照商品目錄的說明，消費滿五百元可以打八五折。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-24","sourceFront":"目錄","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"百貨公司經常辦活動及送贈品，都是為了鼓勵客人多消費。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-44","sourceFront":"贈品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"購物是一種享受，超過個人需求的消費，卻只會帶來煩惱。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-43","sourceFront":"享受","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"過度消費及使用塑膠材料的產品，都會增加自然環境的負擔。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-24","sourceFront":"塑膠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L03-1-17\",\"书籍\",\"書籍\",\"书籍\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"這些跟卡通人物有關書籍，很適合兒童閱讀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-17","sourceFront":"書籍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"教授的房間堆滿了各種書籍，本來就不大的房間感覺更擠了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-25","sourceFront":"堆","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"向圖書館借的書籍要是超過規定的時間沒還，可是要罰錢的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-31","sourceFront":"罰","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"本市的市立圖書館的書籍豐富，來借書的民眾也不少。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-09","sourceFront":"市立","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"華語書籍陳列在書架的左邊，如有興趣可隨意翻翻。","pi