13-1-02","sourceFront":"機械","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"人們為了節省勞力，發明了許多實用的機械。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-1-37","sourceFront":"勞力","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-1-28\",\"点燃\",\"點燃\",\"点燃\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"總統在廣場點燃煙火，跟民眾一起慶祝新年。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-28","sourceFront":"點燃","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L16-2-13\",\"来自\",\"來自\",\"来自\",\"Vpt\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"錯誤通常來自粗心，因此無論事情大小都該用心處理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-13","sourceFront":"來自","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"word\",\"動\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 重(heavy) load takes 力(strength) and will to 動(move) it."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"商業\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 商(commerce) and 業(business): 商業 means commerce, business."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"在意\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 在(at) and 意(thought): 在意 means care about."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"意外\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Combining 意(thought) and 外(out): 意外 means accident."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"日本\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"日(sun) + 本(origin) → 'origin of the sun', the land where it rises: 日本 is Japan."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"法\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"a 氵(water) washes a 去(go away) mark off the stone → 法(law)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"濕\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Streams of 氵(water) soak through beams of bright 日(sun) light on twisted 糹(silk) until everything is 濕(wet)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"糕\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"Steamed 米(rice) stands shaped like a 羔(lamb) → sweet 糕(cake)."},{"key":"[\"word\",\"飲料\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"飲(drink) + 料(material) → the material you drink: 飲料(beverage)."}]}
